  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Slit the <b>mentaiko</b> sac and scrape the roe out of its skin.</li><li>Stir it with the <b>mayo</b>, then fold in the <b>cream cheese</b> cubes without breaking them.</li></ul>",
