  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>For the shop-style finish, set a little of the same filling on top so you can see what is inside. Leave the top uncovered by nori.</li><li>Wrap one strip of nori around the base and up the sides just before serving. Eat within the hour while the nori is crisp. The sliced example shows the inside; cutting yours open is optional.</li></ul>",
